          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A surface cleaner and a turbo nozzle are complementary, not competing. The surface cleaner gives fast, even results on large flat concrete. The turbo nozzle handles the worst stains, the edges and the spots a deck cannot reach. Used together, they get a driveway cleaner than either alone.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
